Video frames from software decoders reached the compositor only as BGRx/BGRA without GStreamer GL:
a videoconvert converted every frame on the CPU (~0.5 core for 720p30 on the A133) before the
compositor uploaded it. Let the non-GL sink take I420/YV12/NV12/NV21 too (preferred), upload each
plane into an R8/RG8 texture (GLES 3) in the compositor thread and draw them with the existing YUV
shader (CoordinatedPlatformLayerBufferYUV), as for GStreamer GL frames.

